# Copy and compliance

**Canonical source:** [docs/COPY-GUIDELINES.md](../../docs/COPY-GUIDELINES.md)

Before writing or changing **user-facing copy or code** (identifiers, comments, docs, commits), read that file and follow it.

When copy or compliance rules change, update **COPY-GUIDELINES.md** in the same change set. Do not edit only this rule file or let the rule body diverge from the doc.
